00:06:38,823 --> 00:06:44,823
In this operation, everyone has a part to play.

2
00:13:17,647 --> 00:13:23,647
Operation Fortune: Ruse de Guerre is a action, comedy,
thriller film directed by Guy Ritchie.

3
00:19:56,470 --> 00:20:02,470
Special agent Orson Fortune and his team of operatives recruit one of Hollywood's biggest movie stars to help them on an
undercover mission when the sale of a deadly new weapons technology threatens to disrupt the world order.

4
00:26:35,294 --> 00:26:41,294
Orson, played by Jason Statham.

5
